  "causebase_summary": "Asia Pacific Diocese of Malankara (Indian) Orthodox Syrian Church Ltd is presented on its website as a regional diocese of the Malankara Orthodox Syrian Church headquartered in Canberra, Australian Capital Territory. The diocese is described as having jurisdiction across the Asia & Pacific region, including Australia, New Zealand, Malaysia and Singapore; the site states the new diocese became effective from 1 November 2024. The homepage lists more than 2,000 members and over 20 parishes. Leadership names shown on the site include H.H. Baselios Marthoma Mathews III (Catholicos of the East & Malankara Metropolitan) and H.G. Dr. Yuhanon Mar Diascoros (Diocesan Metropolitan). The site provides navigation links labelled “Our Diocese”, “Ministries”, “Parishes”, “Priests”, and “Notices & News”, and a newsletter subscription field and contact email (secretary@asiapacificdiocese.org). An ACNC Register extract for the organisation is noted in the evidence pack. The available sources are a homepage snapshot and a regulatory register entry; no detailed program descriptions, service-level information or financial records were provided in the supplied evidence.",
